#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Stenmark is your markdown librarian: a GTK4 Markdown reader, organizer and "
"editor built with libadwaita. It features a split-pane editor with live "
"preview, syntax highlighting, table of contents navigation, and a folder-"
"based document browser."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Features:"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Live preview with synchronized scrolling"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "CodeMirror 6 editor with Markdown syntax highlighting"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Folder-based document sidebar with pinning support"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid "Code block syntax highlighting with copy button"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:24
msgid "Interactive task list checkboxes"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:25
msgid "Table of contents navigation"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:26
msgid "Light and dark theme support"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:37
msgid "Kreuder"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:47
msgid "Reading a document beside the folder sidebar"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:51
msgid "Editing Markdown with syntax highlighting"
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:65
msgid ""
"Corrected the version this metadata reports: it had stopped at 0.3.3, so "
"software centres named the wrong release."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid ""
"German translation and a language picker, a Flatpak of its own, a Support "
"item in the menu, and a move to GPL-3.0-only."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:75
msgid ""
"The preview pane starts off and remembers your last choice; the sidebar tag "
"list refreshes as tags change."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:80
msgid "Tagging, and filtering documents by one or more tags."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:85
msgid ""
"Navigation between linked documents, Stenmark offered as an \"Open with\" "
"handler, and fixes to the sidebar outside the root folder."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:90
msgid ""
"Renamed from Marklite to Stenmark, with a new icon and AppStream metadata."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:95
msgid "Switched to Phosphor Icons, fixed opening directories via CLI argument."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:100
msgid "Better new document behaviour, minor UI improvements."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.singular.stenmark.metainfo.xml.in:105
msgid "Added pin-to-top for folders, various fixes and cleanup."
msgstr ""

